nis operasional harian.</li><li>Menyusun laporan kinerja dan mendokumentasikan prosedur standar operasional (SOP).</li></ul></div></div></div></section></div><div><section class="section" data-section="skills"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading">Keahlian</h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item"><h3 class="item-title">Frontend Development Ceritanee</h3><span class="meta">React, Next.js, TypeScript, Tailwind CSS, Desain Sistem, Vitest, Playwright</span></div></div></section></div><div><section class="section" data-section="projects"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading">Proyek</h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item"><div class="item-header"><h3 class="item-title"><a href="https://inventaris-luwunggede.id/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">Portal Pelayanan Desa Luwunggede</a></h3><div class="item-date">Juli 2026 - Agustus 2026</div></div><div class="rich-text"><ul>Proker Individu KKN Jierrrs.</ul></div></div></div></section></div><div><section class="section" data-section="education"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading">Pendidikan</h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item"><div class="item-header"><div class="item-header-main"><h3 class="item-title">Universitas Muhadi Setiabudi</h3><em class="meta italic">S1 Teknik Informatika</em><span class="meta">Brebes, Indonesia</span><span class="meta">GPA: 3.85 / 4.00</span></div><div class="item-date">September 2023 - September 2027</div></div><div class="rich-text"><ul><li>Fokus pada pengembangan Frontend dan Machine Learning Ceritanee.</li></ul></div></div></div></section></div><div><section class="section" data-section="certifications"><h2 class="section-heading" data-testid="resume-preview-section-heading">Sertifikasi</h2><div class="item-list"><div class="item"><div class="item-header"><div class="item-header-main"><h3 class="item-title"><a href="https://www.dicoding.com/certificates/MEPJ279GWP3V"